{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully customize and build your own car! This hardcore automotive game requires basic car knowledge, allowing highly free adjustment of performance parameters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meanwhile, design your vehicle\u2019s appearance with voxel-based modular building blocks for limitless creativity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pre-made templates are provided for inspiration if you need guidance!(There's a simple step-by-step tutorial in the intro video.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultimately, create a completely unique car to conquer race tracks and off-road challenges! Compete online with friends and showcase your engineering masterpiece!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(This game is independently developed by a solo creator pursuing a game-design dream. Overcoming countless challenges from programming, 3D modeling, to technical art \u2013 every aspect was self-taught from scratch. Your support is greatly appreciated!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uff08Looking for tutorials, reporting bugs, or finding friends to play together? Click the link to join the QQ group or Discord.\uff09</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3581680?t=1750725472","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581680/83f58d9fe96d711b0d294d286f3d21686c2cefc8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750725472","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581680/cb3baafbe1cc012a2b5ce116cc09191d66f941f4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750725472","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581680/cb3baafbe1cc012a2b5ce116cc09191d66f941f4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750725472","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully customize and build your own car! This hardcore automotive game requires basic car knowledge, allowing highly free adjustment of performance parameters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meanwhile, design your vehicle\u2019s appearance with voxel-based modular building blocks for limitless creativity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pre-made templates are provided for inspiration if you need guidance!(There's a simple step-by-step tutorial in the intro video.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultimately, create a completely unique car to conquer race tracks and off-road challenges! Compete online with friends and showcase your engineering masterpiece!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(This game is independently developed by a solo creator pursuing a game-design dream. Overcoming countless challenges from programming, 3D modeling, to technical art \u2013 every aspect was self-taught from scratch. Your support is greatly appreciated!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uff08Looking for tutorials, reporting bugs, or finding friends to play together? Click the link to join the QQ group or Discord.\uff09</p>","developers":["Z's Quest Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581680/26f46e68e841092cfa55eaa003675c9108d51813/header.jpg?t=1750725472","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3581680/848117/3015f620f536269b0e6f2fc833c873fcc7aab474/1750460255/dash_av1.mpd?t=1742829560","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3581680/848117/3015f620f536269b0e6f2fc833c873fcc7aab474/1750460255/dash_h264.mpd?t=1742829560","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3581680/848117/3015f620f536269b0e6f2fc833c873fcc7a